                                    "rankScore": 1.0,
                                    "offset": 507,
                                    "length": 203
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "We believe XYZ-code will enable us to fulfill our long-term vision: cross-domain transfer learning, spanning modalities and languages.",
                                    "rankScore": 0.86,
                                    "offset": 711,
                                    "length": 134
                                },
                                {
